{"ID":"20240205165626-9aqyk0i","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205165626-9aqyk0i","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165626-9aqyk0i\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206092023-tu58q8m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607105536-70ts7g8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1800,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240616100209-jbcewpw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:37,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:37\u0026#125;","title":"036薯蓣（署豫、山药、淮山）","type":"doc","updated":"20240731190036"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206092023-tu58q8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092023-tu58q8m","updated":"20240206092029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于河南、山西、河北、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t略呈圆柱形，弯曲而稍扁，长1530cm，直径1. 56cm。表面黄白色或淡黄色，有纵沟、纵皱纹及须根痕，偶有浅棕色外皮残留。体重，质坚实，不易折断，断面白色，粉性。无臭，味淡、微酸，嚼之发粘。光山药呈圆柱形，两端平齐，长918cm，直径1. 53cm。表面光滑，白色或黄白色。\n【性味】\t甘、平。\n【功效】\t补脾养胃，生津益肺，补肾涩精。用于脾虚食少，久泻不止，肺虚喘咳，肾虚遗精，带下，尿频，虚热消渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240206092017-x6kaa1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092017-x6kaa1z","updated":"20240206092017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206092017-s0b04di.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240731164631-d2yph1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240731164631-d2yph1t","updated":"20240731164631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 651px;","style":"width: 641px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"山药 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Da